(1,'SOAI-20260805-1001','Room 1115',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-05 08:05:00','The bedside light is not working even after switching it on.','Electrical','D5020 Lighting Not Working Related','D5020 Lighting & Branch Wiring','Lamp does not illuminate from the room switch.','Failed lamp, loose connection, or local branch circuit fault.','Use standard maintenance safety precautions.','Operate the light repeatedly and confirm stable illumination.','Inspect the lamp, socket, switch, and branch wiring and replace the failed part.','Check guest-room lighting during routine room inspections.','Medium','Standard','false','30 min response / 90 min repair','30 / 90 minutes','55 min','Within SLA','no','no','2026-08-05 08:18:00','TECH-007','TECH-007','Completed','2026-08-05 09:00:00',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.89875,0.19801),
